<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S FORBES GROUP LISTS ON JSE.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S FORBES GROUP LISTS ON JSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forbes Group Ltd announced that about 210 million ordinary shares of one cent each in Forbes would be listed on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) with effect from Monday.</p>
<p>The shares would be listed in the Financial-&quot;Insurance&quot; sector under the name Forbes.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
